{"schema_version":3,"pack_id":"m1s1-u2","title":"정수와 유리수","school":"middle","grade":1,"semester":1,"unit_id":"m1s1-u2","unit_order":2,"standards":["[9수01-03]","[9수01-04]","[9수01-05]"],"economy":{"carry_capacity":120,"coin_per_kill":1,"min_spawn_coins":140},"items":[{"id":"m1s1-u2-001","prompt":"다음 중 음수를 고르시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−2","choices":["0","−2","+3","{frac:1/2}"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":-2,"explain":"0보다 작은 수가 음수이므로 −2입니다. 0은 양수도 음수도 아닙니다.","unitConcept":"양수와 음수","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.zero-as-negative","m1s1-u2.sign-confused","m1s1-u2.fraction-as-negative"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-002","prompt":"(+3)+(−5)를 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−2","choices":["8","−8","−2","2"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":-2,"explain":"절댓값의 차 5−3=2에 절댓값이 큰 수의 부호 −를 붙여 −2입니다.","unitConcept":"정수의 덧셈","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.sign-ignored","m1s1-u2.abs-added","m1s1-u2.sign-error"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-003","prompt":"(−4)+(−6)을 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−10","choices":["10","−10","−2","2"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":-10,"explain":"부호가 같으므로 절댓값의 합 10에 공통인 부호 −를 붙여 −10입니다.","unitConcept":"정수의 덧셈","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.sign-dropped","m1s1-u2.subtract-instead","m1s1-u2.subtract-instead"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-004","prompt":"(+2)−(+7)을 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−5","choices":["−5","5","9","−9"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":-5,"explain":"(+2)−(+7)=(+2)+(−7)=−5입니다.","unitConcept":"정수의 뺄셈","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.order-reversed","m1s1-u2.sign-flip-error","m1s1-u2.sign-flip-error"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-005","prompt":"(−3)−(−8)을 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"5","choices":["−11","11","5","−5"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":5,"explain":"(−3)−(−8)=(−3)+(+8)=5입니다.","unitConcept":"정수의 뺄셈","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.subtrahend-sign-kept","m1s1-u2.sign-error","m1s1-u2.order-reversed"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-006","prompt":"(−3)×(+5)를 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−15","choices":["15","−15","2","−8"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":-15,"explain":"부호가 다른 두 수의 곱은 음수이므로 −15입니다.","unitConcept":"정수의 곱셈","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.sign-rule","m1s1-u2.add-instead","m1s1-u2.add-instead"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-007","prompt":"(−4)×(−6)을 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"24","choices":["−24","−10","10","24"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":24,"explain":"부호가 같은 두 수의 곱은 양수이므로 24입니다.","unitConcept":"정수의 곱셈","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.sign-rule","m1s1-u2.add-instead","m1s1-u2.add-instead"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-008","prompt":"(−12)÷(+3)을 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−4","choices":["−4","4","−36","−9"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":-4,"explain":"부호가 다른 두 수의 나눗셈은 음수이므로 −4입니다.","unitConcept":"정수의 나눗셈","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.sign-rule","m1s1-u2.multiply-instead","m1s1-u2.add-instead"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-009","prompt":"−5의 절댓값을 구하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"5","choices":["−5","0","{frac:1/5}","5"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":5,"explain":"수직선에서 −5는 원점으로부터 5만큼 떨어져 있으므로 절댓값은 5입니다.","unitConcept":"절댓값","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.sign-kept","m1s1-u2.zero-confused","m1s1-u2.reciprocal-confused"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-010","prompt":"다음 중 가장 큰 수를 고르시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−1","choices":["−8","−3","−1","−5"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":-1,"explain":"음수는 절댓값이 작을수록 크므로 −1이 가장 큽니다.","unitConcept":"수의 대소 관계","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.abs-compare","m1s1-u2.abs-compare","m1s1-u2.sign-ignored"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-011","prompt":"다음 중 가장 작은 수를 고르시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−2","choices":["0","+1","−2","−{frac:1/2}"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":-2,"explain":"음수 중 절댓값이 가장 큰 −2가 가장 작습니다.","unitConcept":"수의 대소 관계","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.zero-smallest","m1s1-u2.sign-ignored","m1s1-u2.fraction-negative"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-012","prompt":"수직선에서 원점으로부터의 거리가 3인 수를 모두 구하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"+3, −3","choices":["+3","−3","0, 3","+3, −3"],"format":"text","explain":"원점의 오른쪽과 왼쪽에 하나씩 있으므로 +3, −3입니다.","unitConcept":"절댓값","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.negative-missed","m1s1-u2.positive-missed","m1s1-u2.origin-included"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-013","prompt":"다음 중 정수가 아닌 것을 고르시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−{frac:3/2}","choices":["0","−7","−{frac:3/2}","+5"],"format":"frac","answerNumeric":-1.5,"explain":"−{frac:3/2}은 정수가 아닌 유리수입니다. 0과 음의 정수도 정수입니다.","unitConcept":"정수와 유리수","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.zero-not-integer","m1s1-u2.negative-not-integer","m1s1-u2.sign-not-integer"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-014","prompt":"영상 5 °C를 +5 °C로 나타낼 때, 영하 3 °C를 부호를 사용하여 나타내시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−3 °C","choices":["+3 °C","−3 °C","−5 °C","+2 °C"],"format":"text","answerNumeric":-3,"explain":"영상을 +로 나타내면 영하는 −로 나타내므로 −3 °C입니다.","unitConcept":"양수와 음수","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.sign-confused","m1s1-u2.reference-copied","m1s1-u2.difference-computed"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-015","prompt":"(+6)÷(−2)를 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−3","choices":["3","−3","−12","8"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":-3,"explain":"부호가 다른 두 수의 나눗셈이므로 −(6÷2)=−3입니다.","unitConcept":"정수의 나눗셈","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.sign-rule","m1s1-u2.multiply-instead","m1s1-u2.subtract-instead"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-016","prompt":"(−3)<sup>2</sup>의 값을 구하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"9","choices":["9","−9","−6","6"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":9,"explain":"(−3)<sup>2</sup>=(−3)×(−3)=9입니다.","unitConcept":"거듭제곱의 계산","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.sign-error","m1s1-u2.base-times-exponent","m1s1-u2.base-times-exponent"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-017","prompt":"(+1.5)+(−2.5)를 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−1","choices":["1","−4","4","−1"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":-1,"explain":"절댓값의 차 2.5−1.5=1에 −를 붙여 −1입니다.","unitConcept":"유리수의 덧셈","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.sign-error","m1s1-u2.abs-added","m1s1-u2.abs-added"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-018","prompt":"−3의 역수를 구하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−{frac:1/3}","choices":["−{frac:1/3}","{frac:1/3}","3","−3"],"format":"frac","answerNumeric":-0.3333333333333333,"explain":"곱해서 1이 되는 수이므로 −3의 역수는 −{frac:1/3}입니다.","unitConcept":"역수","difficulty":1,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.sign-flipped","m1s1-u2.opposite-number","m1s1-u2.self"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-019","prompt":"(−2)×(−3)×(−2)를 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−12","choices":["12","−7","−12","7"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":-12,"explain":"음수가 3개이므로 곱의 부호는 −이고, 절댓값은 12입니다.","unitConcept":"정수의 곱셈","difficulty":2,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.sign-count","m1s1-u2.add-instead","m1s1-u2.add-sign-error"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-020","prompt":"−2보다 크고 +5보다 작은 정수의 개수를 구하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"6","choices":["6","7","8","3"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":6,"explain":"−1, 0, 1, 2, 3, 4의 6개입니다.","unitConcept":"수의 대소 관계","difficulty":2,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.endpoint-included","m1s1-u2.both-endpoints","m1s1-u2.negatives-ignored"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-021","prompt":"{frac:1/2}+(−{frac:1/3})을 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"{frac:1/6}","choices":["−{frac:1/6}","{frac:1/6}","{frac:5/6}","0"],"format":"frac","answerNumeric":0.16666666666666666,"explain":"{frac:3/6}+(−{frac:2/6})={frac:1/6}입니다.","unitConcept":"유리수의 덧셈","difficulty":2,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.sign-error","m1s1-u2.sign-ignored","m1s1-u2.add-num-den"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-022","prompt":"(−{frac:2/3})×(+{frac:3/4})을 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−{frac:1/2}","choices":["{frac:1/2}","−{frac:1/2}","−{frac:8/9}","−{frac:5/7}"],"format":"frac","answerNumeric":-0.5,"explain":"부호는 −이고 {frac:2/3}×{frac:3/4}={frac:1/2}이므로 −{frac:1/2}입니다.","unitConcept":"유리수의 곱셈","difficulty":2,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.sign-rule","m1s1-u2.divide-instead","m1s1-u2.add-num-den"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-023","prompt":"(−8)÷(−{frac:2/3})을 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"12","choices":["12","−12","{frac:16/3}","−{frac:16/3}"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":12,"explain":"(−8)×(−{frac:3/2})=12입니다.","unitConcept":"유리수의 나눗셈","difficulty":2,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.sign-rule","m1s1-u2.multiply-instead","m1s1-u2.multiply-sign-error"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-024","prompt":"−3<sup>2</sup>의 값을 구하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−9","choices":["9","−6","−9","6"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":-9,"explain":"−3<sup>2</sup>=−(3×3)=−9입니다. (−3)<sup>2</sup>과 다릅니다.","unitConcept":"거듭제곱의 계산","difficulty":2,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.base-includes-sign","m1s1-u2.base-times-exponent","m1s1-u2.base-times-exponent"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-025","prompt":"3−(−2)×4를 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"11","choices":["20","−5","−11","11"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":11,"explain":"곱셈을 먼저 하면 (−2)×4=−8이고, 3−(−8)=11입니다.","unitConcept":"혼합 계산","difficulty":2,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.left-to-right","m1s1-u2.sign-error","m1s1-u2.whole-sign-error"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-026","prompt":"(−12)÷4×(−3)을 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"9","choices":["1","−9","−1","9"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":9,"explain":"앞에서부터 계산하면 (−12)÷4=−3, (−3)×(−3)=9입니다.","unitConcept":"혼합 계산","difficulty":2,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.multiply-first","m1s1-u2.sign-rule","m1s1-u2.multiply-first-sign"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-027","prompt":"절댓값이 4 이하인 정수의 개수를 구하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"9","choices":["4","8","5","9"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":9,"explain":"−4, −3, −2, −1, 0, 1, 2, 3, 4의 9개입니다.","unitConcept":"절댓값","difficulty":2,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.positive-only","m1s1-u2.zero-missed","m1s1-u2.nonnegative-only"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-028","prompt":"다음 중 두 수의 대소 관계가 옳은 것을 고르시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−{frac:1/2}>−{frac:2/3}","choices":["−{frac:1/2}>−{frac:2/3}","−3>−1","0<−2","−{frac:1/3}<−{frac:1/2}"],"format":"text","explain":"{frac:1/2}<{frac:2/3}이므로 음수에서는 −{frac:1/2}>−{frac:2/3}입니다.","unitConcept":"수의 대소 관계","difficulty":2,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.abs-compare","m1s1-u2.zero-compare","m1s1-u2.abs-compare"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-029","prompt":"(−{frac:1/2})<sup>2</sup>×(−8)÷2를 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−1","choices":["1","−1","−2","−4"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":-1,"explain":"{frac:1/4}×(−8)=−2이고, (−2)÷2=−1입니다.","unitConcept":"혼합 계산","difficulty":3,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.square-sign-error","m1s1-u2.division-missed","m1s1-u2.multiply-instead"]},{"id":"m1s1-u2-030","prompt":"5+(−3)×{2−(−4)}를 계산하시오.","answer_mode":"choice","answer":"−13","choices":["11","12","−13","23"],"format":"int","answerNumeric":-13,"explain":"2−(−4)=6, (−3)×6=−18, 5+(−18)=−13입니다.","unitConcept":"혼합 계산","difficulty":3,"distractor_tags":["m1s1-u2.inner-sign-error","m1s1-u2.left-to-right","m1s1-u2.product-sign-error"]}]}